    <div>
      <h3 class="text-xs font-mono font-semibold uppercase tracking-wider text-foreground">Live concrete volume geometry</h3>
      <p class="mt-1 max-w-[650px] text-[11px] leading-5 text-muted-foreground">
        Technical plan, elevation, and section views update with the selected concrete shape and active dimensions. Schematic only — not to scale.
      </p>
    </div>
    <span class="rounded-full border border-border bg-muted px-2 py-1 font-mono text-[10px] text-muted-foreground">9 LIVE SHAPES</span>
  </div>

