      <title id={`${slug}-rich-title`}>Live concrete volume geometry diagram</title>
      <desc id={`${slug}-rich-desc`}>
        Technical diagrams for nine concrete shapes including slabs, cylinders, hollow tubes, curb and gutter, stairs, wedges, walls, footings and rectangular columns. Labels update from calculator inputs.
      </desc>

